<title>UK: Hungary to raise about $1.1 bln via privatisation.</title>
<headline>Hungary to raise about $1.1 bln via privatisation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary plans to raise around $1.1 billion through privatisation this year, Privatisation Minister Judit Csiha told Reuters in an interview on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This year we are expecting approximately 150 to 180 billion forints which is around $1.1 billion (to be raised through privatisation),&quot; Csiha said.</p>
<p>So far between $5.0 and $6.0 billion has been raised through the privatisation of state assets.  </p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
